## ⚡ URL Parameters Quick Sheet

```text
# Pro Gamer Cyberpunk (Twitch + Kick Dual Stream)
overlay.html?twitch=tarik&kick=xqc&theme=neon&anim=glitch&sound_profile=cyber

# Tactical Valorant Style (with high-contrast black outline)
overlay.html?twitch=shroud&theme=valorant&anim=slide&stroke=1&sound_profile=ping

# OLED Stealth Minimal (0% transparent floating text)
overlay.html?twitch=tarik&theme=stealth&opacity=0&stroke=1&font=inter

# Magma Apex Champion Style
overlay.html?kick=trainwreck&theme=fire&anim=pop&sound_profile=coin

# YouTube Live with SuperChat Alerts
overlay.html?yt_key=AIzaSy...&yt_vid=dQw4w9WgXcQ&theme=glass&font=chakra

# Offline Simulation / Demo Mode
overlay.html?demo=1&theme=synthwave&anim=glitch&sound_profile=cyber&status=1
```
